  "step2Guide": "Yadda ake kunna Shizuku",
  "blurFailOldAndroid": "Ba ya aiki: a wannan sigar Android, murfin dukkan allo zai hana kowace taɓawa kuma za ku iya maƙalewa (murfin da taɓawa ke ratsa su yana buƙatar Android 12 ko sabo). Idan dusashewa ta kasa tafiya daidai, allon yana bayyana tare da gargaɗi.",
  "guideTitle": "Kunna Shizuku, mataki-mataki",
  "guideOpenDev": "Buɗe “Developer options”",
  "guideOpenShizuku": "Buɗe Shizuku",
  "guideClose": "Rufe",
  "guideBody": "Kuna buƙatar Wi-Fi da Android 11 ko sabo. Ana haɗawa sau ɗaya ne kawai; bayan wayar ta sake kunnuwa, mataki na 7 kaɗai za ku maimaita.\n\n1. Haɗa wayar da Wi-Fi.\n\n2. Kunna saitunan “Developer options”: a saitunan waya, “Settings” › “About phone” › “Software information” › taɓa “Build number” sau 7. (A wasu wayoyi: “Settings” › “About phone” › “Build number”.)\n\n3. Buɗe Shizuku. Idan ya nemi izinin nuna sanarwa, ku amince: ana rubuta lambar haɗawa a cikin sanarwar Shizuku.\n\n4. A cikin Shizuku, ƙarƙashin “Start via Wireless debugging”, taɓa “Pairing”. A shafin da ya buɗe, taɓa “Developer options”, kunna “Wireless debugging” sannan ku tabbatar da “Allow”.\n\n5. Taɓa kalmomin “Wireless debugging” (ba makunnin ba), sannan “Pair device with pairing code” (haɗa waya da lamba). Lamba mai lambobi 6 za ta bayyana.\n\n6. Ku bar wannan shafin a buɗe sannan ku ja sanarwa ƙasa. Idan sanarwar Shizuku ta ce “Pairing service found”, taɓa “Enter pairing code” sannan ku rubuta lambar. Shizuku zai ce haɗawa ta yi nasara.\n\n7. Koma Shizuku sannan ku taɓa “Start” ƙarƙashin “Start via Wireless debugging”. Ku jira har sai ya ce “Shizuku is running”.\n\n8. Dawo Waaiya sannan ku taɓa “Ba da izini”, sannan “Allow”.\n\nBayan wayar ta sake kunnuwa Shizuku yana tsayawa: haɗa da Wi-Fi, sake kunna “Wireless debugging” idan a kashe yake, buɗe Shizuku sannan ku taɓa “Start”. Babu sabon haɗawa.",
  "wsetupRouteTitle": "Saiti a wannan waya",
  "wsetupRouteBody": "Gajerun matakai huɗu, sau ɗaya kawai. Babu ƙarin manhaja, babu kwamfuta. Waaiya yana yi wa kowane mataki alama idan an gama shi.",
  "wizDevTitle": "Kunna saitunan “Developer options”",
  "wizDevBody": "A shafin bayanin waya “About phone”, taɓa “Build number” sau 7, sannan ku dawo nan. Idan ba ku same shi ba, ku bincika “Build number” a cikin saitunan waya “Settings”.",
  "wizDevBodySamsung": "A shafin bayanin waya “About phone” › “Software information”, taɓa “Build number” sau 7, sannan ku dawo nan.",
  "wizDevBodyXiaomi": "A shafin bayanin waya “About phone”, taɓa “OS version” sau 7 (a tsofaffin wayoyi “MIUI version”; a wasu yana ƙarƙashin “Detailed info and specs”), sannan ku dawo nan.",
  "wizDevBodyColoros": "A shafin bayanin waya “About device” (ko “About phone”) › “Version”, taɓa “Build number” sau 7, sannan ku dawo nan.",
  "wizDevBodyVivo": "A shafin bayanin waya “About phone”, taɓa “Software version” sau 7 (a wasu wayoyi: “Software information” › “Build number”), sannan ku dawo nan.",
  "wizDevBodyHuawei": "A shafin bayanin waya “About phone”, taɓa “Build number” sau 7, sannan ku dawo nan.",
  "wizDevBodyTranssion": "A shafin bayanin waya “My phone” (ko “About phone”), taɓa “Build number” sau 7, sannan ku dawo nan.",
  "setupNoteHuawei": "Huawei: wayoyin Huawei da yawa ba su da zaɓin “Wireless debugging”. Idan ba ku same shi a cikin saitunan “Developer options” ba, ku yi amfani da kwamfuta (“Wasu hanyoyi” a ƙasa).",
  "wsetupFilterOn": "Tacewa tana kunne: a wannan sigar Android ba za a iya rubuta lambar a sanarwa ba yayin da take aiki. Ku fara dakatar da tacewa, ko ku yi amfani da raba allo da “Rubuta lambar a nan”.",
  "wizDevSearch": "Sunayen na iya bambanta da harshen wayar: idan ba ku same shi ba, ku yi amfani da wurin bincike da ke saman saitunan waya “Settings”.",
  "wizDevAction": "Buɗe bayanin waya “About phone”",
