  "wsetupDoneBody": "Yanzu Waaiya zai iya yi wa ainihin sauti shiru. Kuna iya kashe “Wireless debugging”.",
  "wsetupDoneHelperBody": "An gama. Wannan waya ba ta barin manhajoji su riƙe waɗannan izini, don haka mataimakin Waaiya ne ke yi wa ainihin sauti shiru. Mataimakin yana tsayawa idan wayar ta sake kunnuwa da kuma idan an sabunta Waaiya. Idan kun buɗe Waaiya bayan haka, zai sake kunna mataimakin da kansa idan “Wireless debugging” yana kunne; idan ba haka ba, zai nuna maɓalli don yin hakan.",
  "helperMissingTitle": "Mataimakin Waaiya ya tsaya",
  "helperMissingBody": "Wannan waya ba ta riƙe izinin Waaiya, don haka Waaiya yana amfani da mataimakinsa. Mataimakin yana tsayawa idan wayar ta sake kunnuwa da kuma idan an sabunta Waaiya. Haɗa da Wi-Fi, kunna “Wireless debugging” a cikin saitunan “Developer options”, sannan ku taɓa “Kunna mataimakin Waaiya”.",
  "helperChannel": "Mataimakin Waaiya",
  "helperStarting": "Ana kunna mataimakin…",
  "helperModeNote": "Wannan waya ba ta barin manhajoji su riƙe waɗannan izini: mataimakin Waaiya ne ke yin aikin. Yana tsayawa idan wayar ta sake kunnuwa da kuma idan an sabunta Waaiya. Idan kun buɗe Waaiya bayan haka, zai sake kunna mataimakin da kansa idan “Wireless debugging” yana kunne; idan ba haka ba, zai nuna maɓalli don yin hakan.",
  "helperTipXiaomi": "Ba dole ba ne, don riƙe izinin har abada (babu mataimaki bayan sake kunna waya): a cikin saitunan “Developer options”, kunna “USB debugging (Security settings)” (zai nemi ku shiga asusun Xiaomi), sannan ku sake yin saitin.",
  "helperTipColoros": "Ba dole ba ne, don riƙe izinin har abada (babu mataimaki bayan sake kunna waya): a cikin saitunan “Developer options”, kunna “Disable permission monitoring” (a sabbin sigogi “Disable system optimization”; wataƙila yana bayyana ne kawai idan harshen wayar Turanci ne), sannan ku sake yin saitin.",
  "stateOnHelperMissing": "Ba a yi wa ainihin sauti shiru ba, don haka kuna jin kiɗan tare da sautin da aka tace: mataimakin Waaiya ya tsaya. Haɗa da Wi-Fi, kunna “Wireless debugging”, sannan ku taɓa “Kunna mataimakin Waaiya”.",
  "setupRefusedTryWireless": "Ko ku yi amfani da “Saiti a wannan waya” a wannan shafi: daga nan mataimakin Waaiya yana aiki ba tare da wannan zaɓin ba.",
