  "wsetupWrongCode": "Ba a karɓi wannan lamba ba. Ku duba lambobi 6 da ke allo sannan ku sake shigar da su. Idan shafin haɗawa ya rufe, ku sake buɗe shi: lambar tana canzawa.",
