  "stateTooSlow": "Wannan waya tana da jinkiri sosai don tace sauti kai tsaye, don haka sautin yana yankewa. “Buɗe mahaɗa” da ke ƙasa yana aiki duk da haka: yana tace bidiyon kafin ya kunna shi.",
